  {
    "id": "9af770c5fd6e4c63",
    "type": "subflow",
    "name": "TV Bring-up",
    "info": "Parameterised TV/soundbar bring-up (movie & Wii share the logic).\n\nenv:\n- `tv_source` — LG webOS source name (Streaming Box / WII)\n- `sound_mode` — soundbar profile (Standard / Bass Blast)\n- `sound_volume` — volume (0.4 / 0.2)\n\nSets `tv_auto_on` on entry, clears it after source select, so the untouched TV-polling section behaves exactly as with the live flow. First internal node reads env into msg via env.get() (same idiom as the Light On subflow), service data uses {{mustache}}.",
    "category": "home_assistant entities",
    "in": [
      {
        "x": 60,
        "y": 110,
        "wires": [
          {
            "id": "afbef9bedd704a9d"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "out": [],
    "env": [
      {
        "name": "tv_source",
        "type": "str",
        "value": "Streaming Box"
      },
      {
        "name": "sound_mode",
        "type": "str",
        "value": "Standard"
      },
      {
        "name": "sound_volume",
        "type": "str",
        "value": "0.4"
      }
    ],
    "meta": {},
    "color": "#D8E8D8",
    "icon": "node-red/light.svg"
  },
